    // PHILARIS-RD's SD Auto Conversion API (SD_Conversion_API_Guide_v1.docx (1).pdf). Only the
    // Development URL has been provided so far - UAT/Production are "to be provided" per that
    // guide; update this before deploying to either environment. The API key (SDAutoConversion:
